# Production build settings (public URLs only, nothing secret).
# The Start form signs shops up through phone-intake (2026-10-05).
VITE_BILLING_BASE_URL=https://intake.inphox.net
# To move sign-ups to the central InPhox Odoo once platform.inphox.net is live, add:
# VITE_PLATFORM_URL=https://platform.inphox.net
# Go-live switch (2026-10-24): once home.inphox.net answers without the access gate, set VITE_SIGNUP_OPEN=1.
# Then every plan button and "Get started" opens home.inphox.net/signup?plan=<code>, and every Sign in link opens
# home.inphox.net/login. Until then plan buttons go to Contact and Sign in to "Sign in to your shop".
# VITE_SIGNUP_OPEN=1
